<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/22/msa@/~cl_18> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/22/msa@> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/22/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/22/msa@/~cl_18> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "18" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/22/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/22/msa@/~cl_18> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#clause> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/22/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/22/msa@/~cl_18> <https://schema.org/name> "Jadual kepada Akta ibu dipinda—"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/22/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/22/msa@/~cl_18__para_a> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/22/msa@/~cl_18> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/22/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/22/msa@/~cl_18__para_a> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "a" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/22/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/22/msa@/~cl_18__para_a> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#paragraph> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/22/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/22/msa@/~cl_18__para_a> <https://schema.org/text> "dalam tajuk, dengan memasukkan sebelum perkataan \"SCHEDULE\" perkataan \"FIRST\";"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/22/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/22/msa@/~cl_18__para_b> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/22/msa@/~cl_18> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/22/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/22/msa@/~cl_18__para_b> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "b" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/22/msa@> .
