<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/22/msa@/~cl_18__para_b> <https://schema.org/text> "dalam subsubperenggan 1(1)(c), dengan menggantikan perkataan \"and sentenced to imprisonment for a term of not less than one year\" dengan perkataan \"involving fraud, dishonesty or moral turpitude, an offence under any law relating to corruption or any' other offence punishable with imprisonment in itself only or in addition to or in lieu of a fine\";"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/22/msa@> .
