<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/22/msa@/~cl_18__para_f> <https://schema.org/text> "dengan memasukkan selepas subperenggan 3(4) subperenggan yang berikut: \"(5) The Board shall have a common seal which shall bear such device as the Board shall approve and such seal may be broken, changed, altered or made anew as the Board deems fit. (6) Until a seal is provided by the Board, a stamp bearing the logo and words \"LPPKN\" may be used and shall be deemed to be the common seal of the Board. (7) The common seal shall be kept in the custody of the Director General or such other person as may be authorized by the Board. (8) The common seal of the Board shall be officially and judicially noticed.\";"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/22/msa@> .
