<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/22/msa@/~cl_18__para_g> <https://schema.org/text> "dengan memotong perenggan 4; dan"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/22/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/22/msa@/~cl_18__para_h> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/22/msa@/~cl_18> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/22/msa@> .
